{"schema": "entry.v2", "id": "kb-bug-1b7861b4d79f", "type": "bug", "scope": {"device": "CSK6 + HiSilicon WS63 双芯片台架（CH344 四串口，dev01）", "project": "cskflashtest / VenusA+WS63", "firmware": "CSK6 V4.1.8@Nov 11 2026 12:27:56 / HISI 46.1.x", "platform": "win003、win005（Windows 10 19045）"}, "title": "win005 HISI 脚本 GBK 控制台 UnicodeEncodeError 中断后处理（退出码 1）", "claim": "win005 的 HISI 烧录脚本在 optLog 已记『烧写结果：成功』之后打印 AT 应答时抛 UnicodeEncodeError（GBK 控制台无法编码），进程 exit 1，导致后续复位与 AT 退出流程未执行，容易被误读成烧录失败。规避：脚本 stdout 统一 utf-8 或 errors='replace'；把『烧录段结果』与『后处理段结果』分开判；本例补做 AT+FTM=0@1500000 成功（+FTM SWITCH: start / OK）即可收口，无需复烧。", "evidence": [{"kind": "issue", "ref": "NOAH-215 评论 01a1ee0e-a296-7f3d-a2d1-1bf6d46c8829", "note": "logs/ws63-at-exit.log、optLog_20261118173859.txt；节点侧文件未上传"}], "confidence": "medium", "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "source_skill": "venusahisiburner", "skill_ref": "burner", "skill_version": "1.1.0", "module": "burn", "firmware_family": "csk6-v4.1.8-hisi-46.1.x", "topology": "csk6-hisi-dual-chip-ch344-dev01", "routing_note": "GBK 控制台问题属烧录后处理，归 burn 模块。该 CSK6(CH344 四串口, dev01) 台架的 profile 未登记进 burner index（现有 tcl-pvm1005 为 CSK7 measured、midea-csk6 为 draft），因此只关联到 skill/module 层；补登记 profile 后再补 capability/workflow。", "created": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "updated": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "hits": 2, "validations": [], "tags": ["hisi", "encoding", "gbk", "unicode-error", "win005", "post-process"], "scope_level": "device_family", "scope_key": "ws63-hisi"}
