{"schema": "entry.v1", "id": "kb-bug-7a4682a3b07c", "type": "bug", "scope": {"device": null, "project": "NoahsArk", "firmware": null, "platform": "knowledge-service"}, "title": "知识服务 proposal 校验静默降级：load_schema 少了 .json 后缀", "claim": "arkks/ledger.py validate_draft 调 module.load_schema(root, \"entry.v1\")，而 schema 文件实际是 schema/entry.v1.json，load_schema 抛 KBError 后被 except Exception 吞掉，降级成只检查字段是否存在的兜底校验。后果：evidence 带未定义字段（如 bytes）、sha256 不是 64 位十六进制的草案同样返回 201，服务对外宣称的 entry.v1 校验并未执行。实测：validate_draft 对 sha256='NOT-A-SHA' + bogus 字段的草案返回 []，日志只剩一行『schema 校验降级』。", "evidence": [{"kind": "file", "ref": "noahsark-knowledge-service:arkks/ledger.py validate_draft", "note": "根因位置：module.load_schema(root, \"entry.v1\") 少了 .json，KBError 被 except Exception 吞掉"}, {"kind": "issue", "ref": "NOAH-86 评论 01a1e414-2000-733a-8f0c-f81405e3d689 附件 audit-candidate.json", "sha256": "31e08c6a5a874da7aef54999ae248f2b356e051f2f5256444c5cbf93773bff02", "note": "草案 evidence 含未定义字段 bytes，服务端仍返回 201"}, {"kind": "file", "ref": "NOAH-86 评论附件 finding-schema-validation.log", "sha256": "1f88c3d92b25a3f65fd0f6b4ee75fd777b3d2180bbb77341d21160e31ae80bf1", "note": "复现日志：validate_draft 对 sha256='NOT-A-SHA' + bogus 字段返回 []"}], "confidence": "medium", "status": "pending", "superseded_by": null, "source_skill": "ark-kb", "created": "2026-11-16T11:15:15Z", "updated": "2026-11-16T11:38:36Z", "hits": 0, "validations": ["noah-86-review-20261116-1905"], "tags": ["capability:knowledge-service"]}
