{"schema": "entry.v1", "id": "kb-bug-a9e3072fbaa0", "type": "bug", "scope": {"device": "CSK6 + HiSilicon WS63 双芯片台架（CH344 四串口，dev01）", "project": "cskflashtest / VenusA+WS63", "firmware": "CSK6 V4.1.8@Nov 11 2026 12:27:56 / HISI 46.1.x", "platform": "win003、win005（Windows 10 19045）"}, "title": "task_tree 角色的 release_not_falling_back 假阳性误判内存泄漏", "claim": "资源门禁对 role=task_tree 也套 release_not_falling_back：release 后只回落 0.36%（16.62 → 16.56 MB、15.94 MB）远低于 5% 阈值，于是两次执行都报 FAIL_TOOL_MEMORY_LEAK，但 release_ok=true、无子进程残留、无孤儿（NOAH-188/212 同源）。规避：release_skip_roles 应包含 task_tree，或对 task_tree 改判『绝对回落量 + 是否有残留进程』；读门禁结果先看 release_ok 与残留进程，再看比例。", "evidence": [{"kind": "issue", "ref": "NOAH-216 评论 01a1ee0c-1104-7a33-bc3d-d6668b69a0ed 附件 summary.json", "sha256": "7ef2b44528d45afe9bcc9d2aff98d16f9fef4cad9305547dbba1d6b795c9a4f1", "note": "11762 B；Multica 附件已下载并本地复算 SHA-256，待节点侧归档 8090 后补 ark:// URI"}, {"kind": "issue", "ref": "NOAH-216 评论 01a1ee0c-1104-7a33-bc3d-d6668b69a0ed 附件 EXECUTION_CHECK.md", "sha256": "0f2df0689184fa7812ec326498d2eef69b0ccc0a179e2a9d1c68b12c5b7ae6ed", "note": "5434 B；Multica 附件已下载并本地复算 SHA-256，待节点侧归档 8090 后补 ark:// URI"}], "confidence": "high", "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "source_skill": "venusahisiburner", "created": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "updated": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "hits": 2, "validations": [], "tags": ["resource-gate", "memory-leak", "false-positive", "task-tree", "win003"], "scope_level": "device_family", "scope_key": "csk6-ws63"}
{"schema": "entry.v2", "id": "kb-bug-aaacbd2d3429", "type": "bug", "scope": {"device": "CSK6 + HiSilicon WS63 双芯片台架（CH344 四串口，dev01）", "project": "cskflashtest / VenusA+WS63", "firmware": "CSK6 V4.1.8@Nov 11 2026 12:27:56 / HISI 46.1.x", "platform": "win003、win005（Windows 10 19045）"}, "title": "package_version_of 把 '4.1.8' 与 'V4.1.8' 比成 VERSION_MISMATCH（假阳性）", "claim": "venusahisiburner 的 package_version_of 从包名提取出 '4.1.8'，与设备上报的 'V4.1.8' 直接做字符串比较，win003 因此在版本完全一致的情况下被判 VERSION_MISMATCH（NEEDS_REVIEW）。规避：比较前统一去掉前导 'V'/小写化，并在回执里同时打印 extracted 与 expected 的原文与规范化值；遇到带 V 前缀的版本只允许判 PASS 或 NEEDS_REVIEW，不得据此触发复烧。", "evidence": [{"kind": "issue", "ref": "NOAH-216 评论 01a1ee0c-1104-7a33-bc3d-d6668b69a0ed 附件 burn-csk6.json", "sha256": "6e19c2cca9c2ac231f5d8809658bccb41d2a395486c04fa6fa30700f6005cd78", "note": "5949 B；Multica 附件已下载并本地复算 SHA-256，待节点侧归档 8090 后补 ark:// URI"}, {"kind": "issue", "ref": "NOAH-216 评论 01a1ee0c-1104-7a33-bc3d-d6668b69a0ed 附件 EXECUTION_CHECK.md", "sha256": "0f2df0689184fa7812ec326498d2eef69b0ccc0a179e2a9d1c68b12c5b7ae6ed", "note": "5434 B；Multica 附件已下载并本地复算 SHA-256，待节点侧归档 8090 后补 ark:// URI"}], "confidence": "high", "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "source_skill": "venusahisiburner", "skill_ref": "burner", "skill_version": "1.1.0", "module": "verify", "firmware_family": "csk6-v4.1.8-hisi-46.1.x", "topology": "csk6-hisi-dual-chip-ch344-dev01", "routing_note": "版本比较假阳性属烧录后版本判定。该 CSK6(CH344 四串口, dev01) 台架的 profile 未登记进 burner index（现有 tcl-pvm1005 为 CSK7 measured、midea-csk6 为 draft），因此只关联到 skill/module 层；补登记 profile 后再补 capability/workflow。", "created": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "updated": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "hits": 2, "validations": [], "tags": ["venusahisiburner", "version-check", "false-positive", "v-prefix", "csk6"], "scope_level": "device_family", "scope_key": "csk6"}
{"schema": "entry.v2", "id": "kb-bug-cdb93160a496", "type": "bug", "scope": {"device": "CSK6 + HiSilicon WS63 双芯片台架（CH344 四串口，dev01）", "project": "cskflashtest / VenusA+WS63", "firmware": "CSK6 V4.1.8@Nov 11 2026 12:27:56 / HISI 46.1.x", "platform": "win003、win005（Windows 10 19045）"}, "title": "win003 profile 的 csk6.burn 缺 invocation/success_markers 导致首跑 exit 2", "claim": "win003 profile 的 csk6.burn 段缺 invocation 与 success_markers，core/phases.py::_csk6_invocation 只读 profile 而不回落 chips/csk6/chip.json，结果首次执行 exit 2 直接拒绝写入（串口都未打开），看起来像工具故障。规避：烧录前先 dryrun 校验 profile 必填段；缺失时从 chips/csk6/chip.json 原样补齐到 work/profiles/ 派生副本再跑，不要改芯片层或历史任务目录。", "evidence": [{"kind": "issue", "ref": "NOAH-216 评论 01a1ee0c-1104-7a33-bc3d-d6668b69a0ed 附件 EXECUTION_CHECK.md", "sha256": "0f2df0689184fa7812ec326498d2eef69b0ccc0a179e2a9d1c68b12c5b7ae6ed", "note": "5434 B；Multica 附件已下载并本地复算 SHA-256，待节点侧归档 8090 后补 ark:// URI"}], "confidence": "high", "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "source_skill": "venusahisiburner", "skill_ref": "burner", "skill_version": "1.1.0", "module": "preflight", "firmware_family": "csk6-v4.1.8-hisi-46.1.x", "topology": "csk6-hisi-dual-chip-ch344-dev01", "routing_note": "profile 缺 invocation/success_markers 属烧录前置检查。该 CSK6(CH344 四串口, dev01) 台架的 profile 未登记进 burner index（现有 tcl-pvm1005 为 CSK7 measured、midea-csk6 为 draft），因此只关联到 skill/module 层；补登记 profile 后再补 capability/workflow。", "created": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "updated": "2026-11-18T15:40:00Z", "hits": 2, "validations": [], "tags": ["venusahisiburner", "profile", "invocation-missing", "exit-2", "win003", "dryrun"], "scope_level": "device_family", "scope_key": "csk6"}
